WEBVTT

00:22.756 --> 00:27.037
I saw the static in your eyes, the silent

00:27.057 --> 00:31.458
screams, the practiced lies.

00:33.595 --> 00:37.657
A pain, a smile, a hollow shell Trapped inside a

00:37.757 --> 00:46.101
private hell I tried cold, I tried to warn All

00:46.141 --> 00:49.662
that cold and broken morn You couldn't hear my

00:49.762 --> 00:54.945
quiet plea But you are finally back with me

00:56.205 --> 01:03.152
And I will never let you go again This is a promise

01:03.452 --> 01:10.096
not a warning for when If the darkness ever calls

01:10.136 --> 01:14.279
your name I'll be the fire, I'll be the flame And

01:14.599 --> 01:15.540
if I have to

01:21.682 --> 01:26.205
With my own two hands

01:26.845 --> 01:33.530
I'll drag you back from those broken lands I'll

01:37.492 --> 01:38.153
take

02:04.259 --> 02:07.622
I'll be the flute song in your head for every

02:07.762 --> 02:10.925
single word unsaid

02:14.848 --> 02:18.992
A steady note, a gentle sound on this new and

02:19.092 --> 02:20.153
solid ground

02:24.101 --> 02:28.346
No more silence, no more fear As long as I am

02:28.366 --> 02:32.090
standing here You'll never have to walk alone

02:32.110 --> 02:34.513
I'll bring my broken brother home

02:38.313 --> 02:44.339
I will never let you go again This is a promise,

02:44.419 --> 02:51.445
not a word if or when If the darkness ever calls

02:51.485 --> 02:59.152
your name I'll be the fire, I'll be the flame And

02:59.212 --> 03:07.565
if I have to With my own two hands,

03:08.186 --> 03:14.750
I'll drag you back from those broken lands.

